7. Importing the VPN Profile on My Computer

I installed the Wireguard on my windows computer. Next, I accessed the VPN using the following steps:

- Opening WireGuard - Clicking the “Add Tunnel → Import from File” - Selecting the file “peer2.conf” - Click on “Activate”, The VPN connection was successful. 8. Verifying the VPN Connection 8.1 Before Connecting I typed the phrase “what is my IP” on Google, with the VPN turned off. This reflected my usual IP address. 8.2 After Connecting Once the VPN was activated, I typed “What is my IP” again into the browser. The new IP address was: 157 This indicated that my Internet traffic was passing through the VPN server.
